      "writtenOn": "2026-09-21T11:18:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Who uses Internal right now?  This is only used by phosphor-user-manager itself as best I can tell.  There is exactly one use right now...\n\n```\n$ rg \"Internal[^F]\"    \nuser_mgr.cpp\n1515:        userInfo.emplace(\"UserType\", convertForMessage(UserType::Internal));\n```\n\nSo I don\u0027t know what you mean by \"complicating every internal check\".",
